  <Docs>
    <summary>Identifies a failure to obtain a surface package from a sandboxed SDK.</summary>
    <remarks>
      <para>The .NET binding groups the surface-package request error constants from <see cref="T:Android.App.SdkSandbox.SdkSandboxManager" /> in this enumeration. A failure can indicate an internal error or an SDK that is not loaded.</para>
      <para>The <see href="https://android.googlesource.com/platform/packages/modules/AdServices/+/refs/tags/android-16.0.0_r1/sdksandbox/framework/java/android/app/sdksandbox/SdkSandboxManager.java">Android 16 request error-code declaration</see> lists these two values in its <c>RequestSurfacePackageErrorCode</c> integer definition; they are error codes, not flags.</para>
    </remarks>
  </Docs>
